t-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Smaller reporting company</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:9.97%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_oEqW0RKNG02TRdjhIpvXzg" name="dei:EntitySmallBusiness" id="Tc_--cX3WkP0Uqj6kP4kvF-tg_1_3"><span style="font-family:'Segoe UI Symbol';">&#9746;</span></ix:nonNumeric></p></td></tr><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:22.25%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:37.58%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"/><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:30.18%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;">Emerging growth company</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:9.97%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric format="ixt-sec:boolballotbox" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_oEqW0RKNG02TRdjhIpvXzg" name="dei:EntityEmergingGrowthCompany" id="Tc_rAv8pYWi6021cBCo5uZIYA_2_3"><span style="font-family:'Segoe UI Symbol';">&#9744;</span></ix:nonNumeric></p></td></tr></table><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:6pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">If an emerging growth company, indicate by check mark if the registrant has elected not to use the extended transition period for complying with any new or revised financial accounting standards provided pursuant to Section&#160;13(a)&#160;of the Exchange Act. <span style="font-family:'Segoe UI Symbol';">&#9744;</span></p><p sty