ricted" scale="0" id="Tc_IU-nVJi8XkuHvT57A6eqvg_12_3">30,839,860</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">During the three months ended June 30, 2026, the Company did <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_v-USg5pnn0OakJhJIRRtgQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_WFD20tyqf0mnSYQI0wnDMg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="kutg:CryptoAssetNumberOfUnitsPurchased" scale="0" id="Narr_MwOoN9THP0WtT_YcJFjPRg">no</ix:nonFraction>t purchase BTC. During the three months ended June 30, 2025, the Company purchased <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_v-USg5pnn0OakJhJIRRtgQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_tUfXAhL5QUeJmf59o8UfYQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetNumberOfUnitsPurchased" scale="0" id="Narr_e76CH4q7lUOJPdyHXPDWeg">244.36</ix:nonFraction> BTC at an average cost of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_tUfXAhL5QUeJmf59o8UfYQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetCostPerCryptoAsset" scale="0" id="Narr_ialLJfbHSkK2NNd5rXcr_A">103,949</ix:nonFraction> per BTC, inclusive of fees and expenses, for an aggregate cost of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_tUfXAhL5QUeJmf59o8UfYQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetPurchase" scale="0" id="Narr_DusO-1Cwmk6HApbQJ__Zvg">25,400,657</ix:nonFraction>. During the three months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_v-USg5pnn0OakJhJIRRtgQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_WFD20tyqf0mnSYQI0wnDMg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetNumberOfUnitsEarnedAsMiningRewards" scale="0" id="Narr_YY_1gGVsQEa9dZCYTe0giw">8.44</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_v-USg5pnn0OakJhJIRRtgQ" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_tUfXAhL5QUeJmf59o8UfYQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetNumberOfUnitsEarnedAsMiningRewards" scale="0" id="Narr_Tho04-2lkE2i6j4AtOpIPw">11.25</ix:nonFraction> BTC have been earned from mining operations, at an average value of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_WFD20tyqf0mnSYQI0wnDMg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetAverageFairValuePerCryptoAsset" scale="0" id="Narr_jGRxjfBaH06xPZ0Q3uVOng">71,821</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_tUfXAhL5QUeJmf59o8UfYQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetAverageFairValuePerCryptoAsset" scale="0" id="Narr_3YIXacLlN0KufSBD7eqzUQ">99,428</ix:nonFraction> per BTC, respectively. During the three months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, the Company recognized mining revenue of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_WFD20tyqf0mnSYQI0wnDMg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetMiningRevenue" scale="0" id="Narr_nRRcnb02GU2G8AfUlH0-0Q">605,982</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_tUfXAhL5QUeJmf59o8UfYQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetMiningRevenue" scale="0" id="Narr_JJz9pAHpBkKpQYd7uPZDAw">1,118,569</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, and received BTC with an aggregate fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_WFD20tyqf0mnSYQI0wnDMg" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetReceivedAsLeaseIncentives" scale="0" id="Narr_xx4cGBfMJUmOcJApHol_dw">8,373</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_tUfXAhL5QUeJmf59o8UfYQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetReceivedAsLeaseIncentives" scale="0" id="Narr_uF2569NYVEe7qe0SYSuxxw">320,526</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, from the lessors as compensation for machine downtime, which is used to offset lease costs.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">20</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">KULR TECHNOLOGY GROUP, INC. AND SUBSIDIARY</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">(unaudited)</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_iJlw2neSa0-ruBMtFgC9xA_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">During the six months ended June 30, 2026, the Company did <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_v-USg5pnn0OakJhJIRRtgQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_SHEh8TM7UEiB9ZsMlFVRsA" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="kutg:CryptoAssetNumberOfUnitsPurchased" scale="0" id="Narr_1UJY5-21aE6PMcp01URlFg">no</ix:nonFraction>t purchase BTC. During the six months ended June 30, 2025, the Company purchased <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_v-USg5pnn0OakJhJIRRtgQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_0mZ-_AECxEiXMDzHIzOP0g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetNumberOfUnitsPurchased" scale="0" id="Narr_fSuTrRPqLEefZh1CQFYgbw">693.81</ix:nonFraction> BTC at an average cost of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_0mZ-_AECxEiXMDzHIzOP0g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetCostPerCryptoAsset" scale="0" id="Narr_zhZt0aosOkqfaSp5YQ7Zcg">100,748</ix:nonFraction> per BTC, inclusive of fees and expenses, for an aggregate cost of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_0mZ-_AECxEiXMDzHIzOP0g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CryptoAssetPurchase" scale="0" id="Narr_lwaaQEiJ8EWnNr-taCzcpA">69,900,009</ix:nonFraction>. During the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_v-USg5pnn0OakJhJIRRtgQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_SHEh8TM7UEiB9ZsMlFVRsA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetNumberOfUnitsEarnedAsMiningRewards" scale="0" id="Narr_gAUo5MoXRUaYtnaSIxvarg">17.23</ix:nonFraction> and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_v-USg5pnn0OakJhJIRRtgQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_0mZ-_AECxEiXMDzHIzOP0g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetNumberOfUnitsEarnedAsMiningRewards" scale="0" id="Narr_H6ZvEJfkl0ucWu_GSHOGlA">14.22</ix:nonFraction> BTC have been earned from mining operations, at an average value of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_SHEh8TM7UEiB9ZsMlFVRsA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetAverageFairValuePerCryptoAsset" scale="0" id="Narr_qeC2BO6VfEiJtRN-fFSwSg">73,594</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_0mZ-_AECxEiXMDzHIzOP0g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetAverageFairValuePerCryptoAsset" scale="0" id="Narr_NtasxQDneUqW93IEoRfnZA">96,225</ix:nonFraction> per BTC, respectively. During the six months ended June 30, 2026 and 2025, the Company recognized mining revenue of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_SHEh8TM7UEiB9ZsMlFVRsA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetMiningRevenue" scale="0" id="Narr_Y-46KQsqnU-I1GGbBU4ykg">1,268,293</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_0mZ-_AECxEiXMDzHIzOP0g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetMiningRevenue" scale="0" id="Narr_0Cp1Jp29yECtdYUi6Lm04A">1,368,323</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, and received BTC with an aggregate fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_SHEh8TM7UEiB9ZsMlFVRsA" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetReceivedAsLeaseIncentives" scale="0" id="Narr_OQWIce44kkyyzBq8a16nyA">18,701</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2025_To_6_30_2025_srt_CryptoAssetAxis_kutg_BitCoinMember_0mZ-_AECxEiXMDzHIzOP0g" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:CryptoAssetReceivedAsLeaseIncentives" scale="0" id="Narr_i4upBGMVUUyz3ptqXPYo8g">320,526</ix:nonFraction> from the lessors as compensation for machine downtime, which is used to offset lease costs.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;">During the three months ended June 30, 2026, the Board of Directors approved management&#8217;s decision that the Company&#8217;s BTC holdings would be available to fund operations, and accordingly, all digital assets were reclassified into current assets as of June 30, 2026.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 10pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Loan Agreement</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March 27, 2026, the Company borrowed $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="As_Of_3_27_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_gVmio66y2ku_uMc9XZNKlQ" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_tX6FELbAPkSkhMqWg9yMEw">5</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;Second Drawdown&#8221;) against its $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="As_Of_3_27_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_gVmio66y2ku_uMc9XZNKlQ" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_mBEpoBgeI02ZX06hynu64Q">20</ix:nonFraction> million credit facility with Coinbase. The Second Drawdown bears a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JSE8NEbN0UGpZJrWILqCFg" contextRef="Duration_3_27_2026_To_3_27_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_ln1VXPUD_kyzVB9qDdGShg" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityCommitmentFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_JPfgtLD6QkKCyXH8JM3sRA">7</ix:nonFraction>% loan fee, and the Company segregated <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_v-USg5pnn0OakJhJIRRtgQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_27_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_gVmio66y2ku_uMc9XZNKlQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:DebtInstrumentNumberOfCryptoAssetsPledged" scale="0" id="Narr_u-65nNFL-0OVLb_xG1fiNg">125</ix:nonFraction> BTC as collateral against this loan. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On May 13, 2026, the Company borrowed an additional $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="As_Of_5_13_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_d7ncW7_SAU6tFflwGAjfvw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:DebtInstrumentFaceAmount" scale="6" id="Narr_mUd5xiX5c0-u5s14ry6Zkw">15</ix:nonFraction> million (the &#8220;Third Drawdown&#8221;) against the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="As_Of_5_13_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_d7ncW7_SAU6tFflwGAjfvw" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityMaximumBorrowingCapacity" scale="6" id="Narr_hsez9i0tPkusGc0BOjhteQ">20</ix:nonFraction> million credit facility with Coinbase. The Third Drawdown bears a <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_JSE8NEbN0UGpZJrWILqCFg" contextRef="Duration_5_13_2026_To_5_13_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_46F9v30AeEO6sU50CizkiA" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LineOfCreditFacilityCommitmentFeePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_RFbm7ivhXk2tWezolE6QVw">7</ix:nonFraction>% loan fee rate per annum, paid monthly, with no scheduled maturity date. During the three months ended June 30, 2026, the Company segregated an additional <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_v-USg5pnn0OakJhJIRRtgQ" contextRef="As_Of_5_13_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_d7ncW7_SAU6tFflwGAjfvw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:DebtInstrumentNumberOfCryptoAssetsPledged" scale="0" id="Narr_fDpUqrB8PEexUKCON90F9Q">440</ix:nonFraction> BTC as collateral, bringing the total BTC pledged as collateral under the credit facility to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_v-USg5pnn0OakJhJIRRtgQ" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_JLDwtB0h1UW0Bkrbnmtp1A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:DebtInstrumentNumberOfCryptoAssetsPledged" scale="0" id="Narr_9AGPJVosu0OpYQYEwlBHAw">565</ix:nonFraction> BTC. The Second and Third Drawdown are subject to the terms and conditions of the Master Loan Agreement.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;">As of June 30, 2026, the full $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_JLDwtB0h1UW0Bkrbnmtp1A" decimals="-6" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:LinesOfCreditCurrent" scale="6" id="Narr_SgLqUfhfAkijbm957hYMWQ">20</ix:nonFraction> million of principal was outstanding and the Company incurred interest expense in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_bRrIRyaoeE2Ei648FudNow" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:DebtInstrumentRepaidInterest" scale="0" id="Narr_aEl6uU27CEWVTEkUXgkE_A">228,219</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_us-gaap_DebtInstrumentAxis_kutg_LoanAgreementMember_zN_n8jq4sUaqt3r_Btg-3Q" decimals="0" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:DebtInstrumentRepaidInterest" scale="0" id="Narr_nFHMD9z430Cr6crJQQsAPg">233,013</ix:nonFraction> for the three and six months ended June 30, 2026. See Note 13 &#8211; Subsequent Events for details related to subsequent repayment of the loan.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_oEqW0RKNG02TRdjhIpvXzg" name="kutg:AutoVibeAssetsDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_hydMoJPriEmkTMFjteuTuw" continuedAt="Tb_hydMoJPriEmkTMFjteuTuw_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE 5 &#8211; AUTO-VIBE ASSETS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In December 2025, the Company entered into a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_12_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_mzFsVUt1UUitm7Rq-WrFfg" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="kutg:VehicleSaleAgreementTerm" id="Narr_9b0XquJQ3E2a6Yj3BkZYwg">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> Master Vehicle Sales Agreement with a licensed Dealership (the &#8220;Dealership&#8221;) in California to buy and sell automobiles as a research and development activity, for the purpose of determining whether the Company&#8217;s technology known as KULR VIBE can be deployed in the automobile market. The Company purchased a range of autos and performed vibration diagnostic testing on a select number of the autos.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During December 2025, the Company allocated $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2025_To_12_31_2025_mzFsVUt1UUitm7Rq-WrFfg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:AutoVibeAssetsAmountAllocated" scale="6" id="Narr_JIqsLcTJak65FL60llgT1g">5.0</ix:nonFraction> million toward this project. Since December 2025, the Company purchased and sold automobiles totaling approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2026_To_6_30_2026_oEqW0RKNG02TRdjhIpvXzg" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:AutovibeAssetsTransferOfVehiclesToDealership" scale="6" id="Narr_FHX8niTpuEaoTL0zuILJjA">4.9</ix:nonFraction> million. The sales of autos to the Dealership did not qualify as sales to customers, therefore no revenue has been recorded for the sales of these autos. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">As of June 30, 2026, the Auto-Vibe assets consist of a gross past due receivable of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_902FLqI8S0izQ8O82cCiTA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:AutoVibeAssetsPastDueReceivablesNoncurrent" scale="6" id="Narr_Oy4nB6P7BEC2fjkmuP3idw">1.0</ix:nonFraction> million, and other gross receivables of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_902FLqI8S0izQ8O82cCiTA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:AutoVibeAssetsPastDueOtherReceivablesNonCurrent" scale="6" id="Narr_j9HvBF1suE6BnnEVuv9SmQ">4.0</ix:nonFraction> million that are past due as of the date of this filing. A credit loss reserve of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_902FLqI8S0izQ8O82cCiTA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:AutoVibeAssetsReceivableNoncurrentAllowanceForCreditLosses" scale="6" id="Narr_B-f7fTFd8UadDhhoGdDiDw">0.5</ix:nonFraction> million was recorded during the six months ended June 30, 2026 against the gross receivables, resulting in a net receivable balance of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_902FLqI8S0izQ8O82cCiTA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:AutoVibeAssetsReceivableNoncurrentNetOfCreditLossesOnValuationAllowance" scale="6" id="Narr_rbNlOv5dCUCvcxZvASrB5g">4.5</ix:nonFraction> million as of June 30, 2026. The parties are in the process of negotiating a planned settlement of the remaining amount due. The Company expects that collection of the $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_v37GyGssvkSdcD0x40TlLw" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2026_902FLqI8S0izQ8O82cCiTA" decimals="-5" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="kutg:AutoVibeAssetsNonCurrent" scale="6" id="Narr_CpXYAMERZ0yG9n1DM6OOOA">4.5</ix:nonFraction> million will likely occur beyond a one-year period and accordingly, such receivable has been reflected as a non-current asset in the June 30, 2026 condensed consolidated balance sheet.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">21</p></div></div>
